---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactNote from '../components/ContactNote.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`What I'm Doing Now | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
  description="What Leon Lin is currently building, thinking about, and interested in."
>
  <h1>What I'm doing now</h1>
  <p class="updated">Updated September 2026.</p>

  <p>
    I'm currently working at the intersection of investing, software, and
    decision-making.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2>Building</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Personal research systems for public markets investing</li>
      <li>
        Avoid Boring People and the infrastructure around its distribution
      </li>
      <li>Experiments in small-scale ownership and investing</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Thinking about</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>AI-enabled research and decision-making workflows</li>
      <li>How technology is changing investment research and markets</li>
      <li>
        How to create asymmetric opportunities in investing, business, and
        careers
      </li>
      <li>
        What world-class performers across different fields have in common
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Interested in meeting</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Exceptional investors, founders, and builders</li>
      <li>Athletes, coaches, and artists who are the best at what they do</li>
      <li>People pursuing something exceptionally ambitious or intriguing</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <p>If any of this resonates with you, I'd love to hear from you.</p>
  <ContactNote />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .updated {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-top: -1rem;
  }
</style>
